rty in power.\n\nThe only public poll, a July survey sponsored by Ford's side, showed a two-point race, but it is months old and carries little weight. The forecast expects Spartz to win by roughly eight points, with meaningful uncertainty given the thin polling and her occasionally turbulent incumbency.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.0883, "margin": -8.48}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.1386, "margin": -8.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.1079, "margin": -9.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.1359, "margin": -8.0}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.1346, "margin": -7.0}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.1196, "margin": -7.5}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.1263, "margin": -8.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.1331, "margin": -8.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.1305, "margin": -8.0}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.1313, "margin": -8.0}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.1321, "margin": -8.0}]}